      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There is a lots of copy past world yes. But as a new creator, being denied to publish might hurt feeling.\nHaving different tab with tag as Avatar/Game/ etc. Might be an option.\nUpload a PC map along a with a QUEST speed up the process since that's the only map they will see in the tab and the number of user grow everyday on that plateforme.",
      "viewerReactions": null
